  "result": "Perfect! The renderInvoiceText function has been successfully enhanced. Here's a summary of what was implemented:\n\n## Enhanced `renderInvoiceText` Function\n\n**New Features Added:**\n\n1. **Line Discount Display** \u2014 Shows discount percentage for each line that has one\n   - Format: `5 Design work (hour) \u20ac85.00 \u20ac425.00 (10% discount)`\n\n2. **Discount Summary Line** \u2014 Shows total discount amount (only when discount > 0)\n   - Format: `Discount: -\u20ac42.50`\n\n3. **Voucher Display** \u2014 Shows voucher before total (only when present)\n   - Format: `Voucher: -\u20ac100.00`\n\n4. **Due Date** \u2014 Shows due date when invoice has one\n   - Format: `Due: 2024-02-14`\n\n5. **Paid Amount** \u2014 Shows total paid so far when payments exist\n   - Format: `Paid: \u20ac500.00`\n\n**Test Coverage (14 new tests):**\nAll 29 render tests pass \u2705\n\n- \u2705 Shows line discounts\n- \u2705 Shows bulk discount in summary\n- \u2705 Shows voucher before total\n- \u2705 Shows due date at end\n- \u2705 Shows paid amount after due date\n- \u2705 Sums multiple payments correctly\n- \u2705 Handles multiple line discounts\n- \u2705 Omits optional elements when not present\n- \u2705 Correct element ordering\n\n**Example Output:**\n```\nINV-2024-0001\nAcme Corp\n5 Design work (hour) \u20ac85.00 \u20ac425.00 (10% discount)\nDiscount: -\u20ac50.00\nVAT: \u20ac78.75\nVoucher: -\u20ac25.00\nTotal: \u20ac428.75\nDue: 2024-02-14\nPaid: \u20ac200.00\n```\n\nThe function maintains all existing functionality while adding these enhancements for a more informative invoice display.",
